  "prompt": "The query in the editor has one mistake. Fix it so that it answers this question: on which dates did Black Friday and Cyber Monday fall, the most recent first? From the calendar table, list the days whose event is 'black_friday' or 'cyber_monday'. Return three columns, in this order: cal_date, weekday_name, event, with exactly these column names. Sort the rows by cal_date from newest to oldest. One row per day.",
